      "ArticleTitle": "Laparoscopic Strassman metroplasty in a postmenarcheal adolescent girl with Herlyn-Werner-Wunderlich müllerian anomaly variant, obstructed noncommunicating didelphic uterus without gartner duct pseudocyst.",
